6052850,蛋友e61f7bef833cc,34256,2025-12-17T11:43:35+08:00,15,12,"A dramatic color film photograph,  a cosplayer as the character YoRHa 2B lying prone on her back on a cold tiled floor,while her mouth opens wide in shock or pain. with short white bob-cut hair, wearing a black visor that obscures her eyes, a black high-collared dress with puffed sleeves and a flared skirt, black gloves, black stockings, and black thigh-high boots,A gloved hand reaches out toward the food scattered around her—McDonald&amp;#39;s fries, nuggets, a yellow cup with red branding, and spilled drink, \nThe setting appears like a deserted urban alleyway at dawn or dusk, bathed in harsh sunlight casting long shadows across the tiles. Cinematic depth-of-field focuses sharply on the central figure against a softly blurred background, emphasizing emotional intensity through dynamic lighting. An intimate overhead perspective captures every detail.\n&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.wangmoyu.com/mw1024/e68981f037b5a08f5beabee92111730d.jpg&#34; /&gt;"
